OL,3,GNEWSASEND provision part of #5.38m
OL,4,Aschool revamp plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #5.38m revamp of a primary school has
OL,7,Fbeen approved by councillors in
OL,8,FPeterborough.
OL,10,FPeterborough City Council's cabinet
OL,11,Fagreed to fund a new car park and a
OL,12,Freception area at Eye Church of England
OL,13,FPrimary School at a meeting on
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FThe plans also include the creation of
OL,17,Fa dedicated provision for children with
OL,18,Fspecial educational needs and
OL,19,Fdisabilities (SEND).
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
