OL,3,GNEWSASEND provision part of #5.38m
OL,4,Aschool revamp plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction of the new car park and
OL,7,Freception area is expected to take
OL,8,Fplace between July and December 2027,
OL,9,Fwith work on the SEND facilities
OL,10,Fscheduled for January and February
OL,11,F2028.
